#
# Well-formed: an exact math:RationalValue carrying an integer numerator and a
# non-zero integer denominator (the pair (1, 4) = 1/4, never a decimal). Conforms to
# math:RationalValueShape. Bound by ex:ecRationalValueWellFormed.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:oneQuarter a math:RationalValue ;
    math:numerator 1 ;
    math:denominator 4 .
